{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026gMZ7i6TCwo1792743396.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>【璀璨之城】<strong>第十集</strong>精華 孝賢自立門戶對抗官家 志琛老奸巨猾暗中截胡！</p><p></p><p>LKS的新公佈引發孝賢、孝君不滿，兩兄弟於早餐時質問志琛，志琛怒斥二人並威脅斷絕關係。最終，孝賢憤然搬離官家，也即時辭去尚利鋒聯席總裁的職務，成立「夢幻之城發展基金」對抗志琛；志琛則成立另一基金並公開宣稱注資一百億，企圖反制。孝賢接觸海外投資者陳在碩，志琛暗中截胡，搶先與在碩會面……</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T15:40:32.613815+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T13:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T19:18:20.882573+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T15:34:01.438838+00:00","content_hash":"dcd9112288640928d276f09a9034af280e7630d47187f0818918c9a2e94e82f3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T15:40:32.613815+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}